## Model card

- **Name:** Muse Spark 1.3
- **Short description:** Meta's frontier coding and long-horizon agentic model with 1M context / 131K output. Contributor/Free and Max are the same weights — only price and training-data consent differ.
- **Provider / access:** Meta Model API; OpenCode Zen `opencode/muse-spark-1.3`. Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-02 release per Meta research blog; knowledge cutoff not announced.
- **IDs:** `opencode/muse-spark-1.3`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 total; 131,072 max output, verified via meta.json.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, PDF in; text out.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** Free OpenCode Zen tier; Contributor $0.10/$0.20; Standard & Max effort $1.25/$4.25 per 1M.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameter count not disclosed.

